; XCOFF text), r3 = r22+1000, r4 = r22+1100, r5 = PA_OpenFirmware (00400000).
; When Open Firmware returns (after its boot of the Mac OS), r5 is stored at
; physical 00400000 and passed on to the NanoKernel in r7.

